{
 "_about": "ComfyUI API-format workflow templates for a FUTURE self-hosted ComfyUI (RunPod worker-comfyui or Modal). Placeholders are whole-string '{{name}}' values filled by hq_creative_presets.fill_workflow (typed). Re-expressed from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates @ 8305a7d4008c64ed52e480d553bd5784011d7b11 (MIT). Model files are listed with their licence: only commercially usable weights are routed (FLUX.1 [dev] is deliberately absent: its weights are non-commercial when self-hosted).",
